{
  "datasets": [
    {
      "displayName": "duration",
      "name": "performance__duration",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `dataset`, MEASURE(`avg_duration_s`) AS `avg_duration_s`, MEASURE(`max_duration_s`) AS `max_duration_s`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_dataset_runs`\n",
        "GROUP BY `dataset`\n",
        "ORDER BY `dataset`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "steps",
      "name": "performance__steps",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `step`, MEASURE(`avg_step_s`) AS `avg_step_s`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_step_time`\n",
        "WHERE `kind` = 'pipeline'\n",
        "GROUP BY `step`\n",
        "ORDER BY `step`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "slow",
      "name": "performance__slow",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `dataset`, `duration_s`, `duration_ratio`, `origin`, `run_id`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_dataset_runs`\n",
        "WHERE `slow` = TRUE\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "retries daily",
      "name": "performance__retries_daily",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `dataset`, MEASURE(`retries`) AS `retries`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_dataset_runs`\n",
        "WHERE `retry` = 1\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`, `dataset`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`, `dataset`"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "displayName": "Performance",
      "layout": [
        {
          "position": {
            "height": 2,
            "width": 6,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "widget": {
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Performance\n",
                "\n",
                "Where does each load spend its time, and is it getting slower? Time per dataset and per step, runs at least twice their own usual time, and re-runs. Only what needs the run log: job-level performance is the platform's own job monitoring screen, and spend belongs to the separate cost product.\n",
                "\n",
                "Owned by observability. Built from the ops metric views over the compact ops tables (run log, daily telemetry copy, freshness, alerts), joined by run id. Discharges DPC-0057, OPS-03."
              ]
            },
            "name": "about"
          }
